      "claim": "The Louvre Pyramid is constructed primarily of laminated glass panels supported by a steel/aluminum framework.",
      "evidence": "Architectural specifications from I.M. Pei’s design documents and the Louvre’s official website list 603 glass panes and a metal structural skeleton.",
